msgstr "拟合期间见到的特征名称。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:96 of
msgid "ndarray of shape (n_features_in_,)"
msgstr "形状为 (n_features_in_,) 的 ndarray"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:100 of
msgid "The number of outputs when fit is performed."
msgstr "执行拟合时的输出数。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:106 of
msgid ""
"Score of the training dataset obtained using an out-of-bag estimate. Only"
" when ``oob_score`` is True."
msgstr "使用袋外估计获得的训练数据集得分。仅在 ``oob_score`` 为 True 时存在。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:109 of
msgid "float"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:113 of
msgid ""
"Prediction computed with out-of-bag estimate on the training set. Only "
"when ``oob_score`` is True."
msgstr "在训练集上使用袋外估计计算的预测。仅在 ``oob_score`` 为 True 时存在。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:116 of
msgid "ndarray of shape (n_samples,)"
msgstr "形状为 (n_samples,) 的 ndarray"

