msgid "备注"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:128 of
msgid "**Limitations compared to scikit-learn**"
msgstr "**与 scikit-learn 相比的限制**"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:130 of
msgid ""
"In addition to the limitations documented in "
":class:`~maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeClassifier` and "
":class:`~maxframe.learn.ensemble.RandomForestClassifier`:"
msgstr ""
"除了 :class:`~maxframe.learn.tree.DecisionTreeClassifier` 和 :class:`~"
"maxframe.learn.ensemble.RandomForestClassifier` 中记录的限制之外："

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:134 of
msgid ""
"Only \"squared_error\" criterion is supported. \"absolute_error\", "
"\"friedman_mse\", and \"poisson\" are not yet available."
msgstr ""
"仅支持 \"squared_error\" 判据。\"absolute_error\"、\"friedman_mse\" 和 \""
"poisson\" 尚不可用。"

#: maxframe.learn.ensemble._forest.RandomForestRegressor:136 of
msgid ""
"The default ``max_features`` is 1.0 (all features), which differs from "
"sklearn's original recommendation of n_features/3 [1]_ but aligns with "
"more recent empirical findings [2]_."
msgstr ""
"默认 ``max_features`` 为 1.0（所有特征），这与 sklearn 原先推荐的 n_"
"features/3 [1]_ 不同，但与较新的实证研究结果 [2]_ 一致。"

